      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>可游玩<color=#ff9900>转盘德比</color>。\n<color=#ff9900>达成BINGO</color>后，\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动限定支援卡</color>和<color=#ff9900>金色结晶片</color>。",
